      <p class="text-gray-900 font-semibold mb-2">
        I learned to run what I build, not just write it.
      </p>
      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        Provisioning the server, securing it, and keeping a long-running
        process alive on 1GB of RAM is its own skill. When a brute-force
        attack took it down, hardening the box (off the default SSH port,
        key-only login) was on me.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div
      class="bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow"
